{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03136","headline":"贺给事尝诣蔡起居郊馆有诗因命同作 · 张九龄","name":"贺给事尝诣蔡起居郊馆有诗因命同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"记言闻直史，筑室面层阿。\n岂不承明入，终云幽意多。\n沈冥高士致，休澣故人过。\n前岭游氛灭，中林芳气和。\n兹辰阻佳趣，望美独如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}